{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watertight is a short psychological-horror experience set aboard a 1950s deep-sea submarine.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles to restore your submarine\u2019s critical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the submarine\u2019s cramped, flooded corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror ambience that amplifies claustrophobia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A concise, intense experience designed to be finished in 30 minutes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped in a failing submarine with systems on the brink of collapse. Complete a series of critical repair tasks to restore power, life-support, and navigation and hope you survive long enough to realize you\u2019re not alone in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan Spedden was just seven years old when he survived the Titanic\u2019s sinking. Both of his parents were lost to the icy depths. Consumed by survivor\u2019s guilt and a lifelong obsession to uncover the wreck, he poured decades into research and planning. In 1952, he abandons everything he holds dear to captain a one-man submarine into the abyss. What he discovers deep beneath the ocean may finally answer his questions\u2026 or destroy what\u2019s left of his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Power Restored","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858990/6cee01ea4d841569a128e0cf9a4c49d838190ada.jpg"},{"name":"Under Pressure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858990/867b06b2fd91c578884527fe06c28da65455ce92.jpg"},{"name":"False Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858990/634d0a8dd81f80d5fc39224da5ad6c235a5a88a9.jpg"},{"name":"Embrace the Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858990/0e1cc792359e633a560884e665258c658b1db824.jpg"},{"name":"Shattered Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3858990/b8f9d53ee30a61144797f4801fc0e1a05ff4fda4.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858990?t=1756239960","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3858990?t=1756239960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/1ec6c584cad0833789e6395689f419b910b61f69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756239960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/1ec6c584cad0833789e6395689f419b910b61f69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756239960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watertight is a short psychological-horror experience set aboard a 1950s deep-sea submarine.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve clever puzzles to restore your submarine\u2019s critical systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the submarine\u2019s cramped, flooded corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror ambience that amplifies claustrophobia</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A concise, intense experience designed to be finished in 30 minutes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re trapped in a failing submarine with systems on the brink of collapse. Complete a series of critical repair tasks to restore power, life-support, and navigation and hope you survive long enough to realize you\u2019re not alone in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/752624c7dc80e441651797dca6b5ab75.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Morgan Spedden was just seven years old when he survived the Titanic\u2019s sinking. Both of his parents were lost to the icy depths. Consumed by survivor\u2019s guilt and a lifelong obsession to uncover the wreck, he poured decades into research and planning. In 1952, he abandons everything he holds dear to captain a one-man submarine into the abyss. What he discovers deep beneath the ocean may finally answer his questions\u2026 or destroy what\u2019s left of his sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.poster.avif?t=1756239960\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.webm?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/extras/0fa6f87ca53689d7140de6e20726547f.mp4?t=1756239960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Tiny Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858990/129b4b0b0a1a89704ccec171afd7a9c9d89ad463/header.jpg?t=1756239960","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3858990/2107305123/b4adc5d944e6a15b9323ba2365309c70b05e28fd/1754708847/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754712001","